 [{:path "specs/legality-workflow/tasks.md",
   :before-present? true,
   :addition
   " P1/P2/P3/P4/P5/P12: validate one active profile (retaining the explicit implementation-seed exception), reusable support sets/exclusions, and post-expansion/pre-optimization admission; emit portable manifests with dependencies/target/providers. Reject hidden runtime services, impure core generation, unsupported facets and generated-profile violations. Core values remain independent of concrete allocation identity; meta raw memory/FFI requires an explicitly allowed audited implementation-provider boundary. Formal admission rejects unmodeled effects/nondeterminism/unsafe code; assumptions remain explicit. Effect allowances and capability grants are separate checks with an explicit provider mapping, never an intersection of differently typed labels.",
   :field-path [:text],
   :marker "legality-implementation-tasks",
   :authority :proposed-interface-amendment,
   :source-sha256
   "937ed9cf0a8a7272559564344141fff0f1e3db34c9deef4106ab3ca958354f9e",
   :insertion :record-tail,
   :after
